{
  "format": "zentrale-schematix-kinds/1",
  "description": "Kinds of things without ZENTRALE that Schematix can place (memory/hub/schematix.md): their NetBox device role and the ports they offer and need (port types of contracts/ports/1/types.json). Node pieces get `node_links` on top of their platform ports so that network and power wires can reach them.",
  "kinds": {
    "router": {"title": "Router", "netbox": "router",
